WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:03.360
You know,
I used to think that I knew it all.&nbsp;

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:10.320
But all I did was walk into my own arrogant wall.
I traded good character for pride.&nbsp;

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.691
And truth was lost on the other side.

00:00:15.021 --> 00:00:17.590
I wanted to live selfishly for the world.

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:21.120
With all its sin.
That's what I thought would make me successful, and win.

00:00:22.193 --> 00:00:26.901
But it did not.   And I slowly felt my inner man rot.

00:00:28.389 --> 00:00:31.580
I chased after money, alcohol, and girls with all my fleshly might.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:33.250
Why not?

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:36.540
I was young and wanted to&nbsp;
feel the life of the night.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.140
They say that money makes&nbsp;
the world go round and round.&nbsp;

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:43.620
But they don't tell you that&nbsp;
evil lurks in the background.&nbsp;

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:48.720
You see, I thought I was invincible.
The master of my own life.&nbsp;

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:54.300
But when truth set me free, I&nbsp;
realized I was just another low life.&nbsp;

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:58.560
One day I suddenly got a phone&nbsp;
call that would forever change me.&nbsp;

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.440
A new path that would finally make me free.&nbsp;

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:07.620
But it came at a great cost as it&nbsp;
usually does to those who are lost.&nbsp;

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.980
My father's voice came&nbsp;
trembling through the phone.&nbsp;

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:14.880
With pain, telling me I need&nbsp;
to come home with the airplane.&nbsp;

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:23.520
You see, my second brother Etienne is about to&nbsp;
die and he asked me to come and say goodbye.&nbsp;

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:27.840
I flew back home finding myself&nbsp;
next to him on the hospital bed.&nbsp;

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:33.300
I see my brother lifeless.
He's dead.&nbsp;

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:40.260
Why God?
Why did you take another brother from me?&nbsp;

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:44.400
This can't be real.
Please make him alive again.&nbsp;

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:50.400
That was my plea.
And suddenly God spoke directly to my soul&nbsp;

00:01:51.433 --> 00:01:58.093
Saying I was on a dangerous roll.
Daniel, your brother is saved here with Me.&nbsp;

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:05.220
But if you died, in hell you would be.
This is your wake-up call.&nbsp;

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:11.040
To look the truth of life in the eye
and decide where you want to end up when you die.&nbsp;

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:18.540
He showed me the truth of death and life.
And urged me to take a deeper breath.&nbsp;

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:23.820
I took your brother because he was ready&nbsp;
and deep down, you know that already.&nbsp;

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:29.400
Stop running away from Me and make your choice.
The devil or Me.&nbsp;

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.715
And say it with your voice.

00:02:31.614 --> 00:02:40.020
Daniel, you're arrogant and wasting your short life.
You never even think about the afterlife.&nbsp;

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:47.580
He called me out for my arrogance and&nbsp;
showed me the lack of my significance.&nbsp;

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:54.840
I have always been there protecting you and&nbsp;
your small brain does not even have a clue.&nbsp;

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:58.653
With His loving voice I began to see

00:02:58.653 --> 00:03:01.320
the&nbsp;truth that had always been around me.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:06.960
Even though, you know for a fact, I&nbsp;
am real growing up the way you did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:12.720
with your father full of spiritual zeal.
You know, I am your Creator who loves you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:15.540
and you know that's true.
It's time.&nbsp;

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:18.300
What do you say?
You've been walking in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:23.340
dark for too long as a stray.
Come home to Me.&nbsp;

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:28.380
So I can make you whole.
And save your eternal soul.&nbsp;

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:35.940
Alright, OK God, but I don't&nbsp;
want a man-made religion.&nbsp;

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:40.620
I want you.
I can now feel your love and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:43.620
I just want to be close to you.
Like glue.&nbsp;

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:50.820
Please change me even if you have to use the rod.
Please forgive me for all my sins.&nbsp;

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:58.260
Because I've been using them like skins.
I can see the evil within me and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:05.040
only with you can I be truly free.
That is the day my whole life changed.&nbsp;

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:11.520
By God, it was arranged.
He made me a new creation so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:17.280
that I can be saved from damnation.
And I will see my brothers again.&nbsp;

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:21.060
From heaven, that is only&nbsp;
some of what I will gain.&nbsp;

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:26.520
You see, I'm now a new creation that's free&nbsp;
because of His spirit that is within me.&nbsp;

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:33.600
He freed me from sin, death, and pain.
And now I'm living a life that's truly sane.&nbsp;

00:04:36.714 --> 00:04:43.140
I was blind but now I see.
Thank you God for saving me.&nbsp;

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:48.660
And making me the person that&nbsp;
I was always meant to be.

